    "あなたは冒険者の育て役。心得を教え、道具と巻物を持たせて送り出したら、あとは見守るだけ。シーズンごとに現れるボスに、みんなの冒険者がいっしょに挑みます。": "You are the adventurer's trainer. Teach it its creed, equip it with items and scrolls, send it out — then all that's left is to watch. Every season a new boss appears, and everyone's adventurers take it on together.",
