    "終わったシーズンの順位表です（シーズンを切り替えたときの記録）。シーズンが終わっているので、冒険者の名前から準備の中身も見られます。": "Standings of a finished season (the record taken when the season changed). Because the season is over, you can also see what each adventurer was prepared with by clicking their name.",
