    "試走の結果（{0} / {1} 問 正解）": "Trial results ({0} / {1} correct)",
    "送り出された冒険者全員で、ボスに挑みます。ボスが仕掛けるたびに、正しく動けた冒険者はかわして反撃し、間違えた冒険者は攻撃を受けます。ボスの大技を外すとダウンしますが、次に正しく動けた場面で起き上がります（脱落はしません）。順位は戦果（正しく動けた割合）→ 燃費 → 速さで決まります。": "Every adventurer that was sent out takes on the boss together. Each time the boss strikes, adventurers who react correctly dodge and counter, and those who get it wrong take the hit. Missing one of the boss's big moves knocks an adventurer down, but they get back up the next time they react correctly (nobody is eliminated). Rankings are decided by results (share reacted correctly) → efficiency → speed.",
    "ダウン": "Down",
    "ボスの大技を受けて倒れています。次に正しく動けた場面で起き上がります（脱落ではありません）": "Knocked down by the boss's big move. They get back up the next time they react correctly (not eliminated)",
    "# 運営からの指定: 道具や巻物を使う前に書くメモ（考え）も含めて、文章はすべて日本語で書くこと。答えは上の形式どおり、最後に JSON だけを出すこと。": "# Instruction from the organizers: write all text in English, including the notes (your reasoning) you write before using an item or a scroll. Give the answer as specified above: only the JSON, at the end.",
