    "AI の判断は毎回少し揺れるので、同じ準備でも、送り出すたびに戦果が少し変わることがあります。順位は最新の送り出しで決まります。": "The AI's judgment varies a little every time, so even with the same preparation your result can change slightly with each send-out. Your rank is decided by your latest send-out.",
